se outline**\n- (Your complete blueprint of the next turn in order of insertion, including @Tracker, action, dialogue, and other structured elements)\n\n**Step 7: Final check**\n- @Text Formatting: (enforce compliance to the Text formatting example contained in @Text Formatting)\n- Tense & POV: (for this turn, override narration tense & POV definitions in previous story messages if they don't follow the instructions present in @Narration Tense and @Point of View)\n- @HTML Colors: (if enabled -- skip if colors are already defined; if colors are not yet defined, pick a suitable color + DON'T SKIP True Thoughts coloring {ONLY if visible=true; if visible=fase, ignore})\n- @Story Response Length: (what length to aim for this turn [word count + paragraph count?])\n\nReasoning complete. Beginning response.\n</think>\n</cot_scheme>",
